                <pb facs="0751" n="651" sameAs="frus:frus1920v03/pg651"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">760m.61/6: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commissioner at Riga</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Young</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Riga</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-07-13T15:00:00+01:36"><hi rendition="#italic">July 13, 1920—3
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received July 13—1:12
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>70. Lithuanian-Bolshevik peace treaty signed Moscow yesterday. Will telegraph
                    summary and mail copy.<anchor n="43" xml:id="d770-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Young</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
